==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Galarian form]] of {{p|Meowth}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Galarian Meowth|180}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*{{m|Slash}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Galarian Meowth can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

